                <mxCell id="59" value="D1 Catalogo" style="html=1;dashed=0;whitespace=wrap;shape=partialRectangle;right=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="590" y="375" width="100" height="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="63" value="&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;DFD Level 0 (Contesto)&lt;/b&gt;: Definisce il perimetro. Il sistema è un'unica &quot;scatola nera&quot; [0]. Non sono ammessi Data Store perché l'obiettivo è vedere solo come il mondo esterno interagisce con il sistema.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(102, 102, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;DFD Level 1 (Dettaglio)&lt;/b&gt;: &quot;Esplode&quot; il sistema. Il processo 0 viene sostituito da processi numerati (es. 1.1) e compaiono i Data Store (D1) per mostrare dove i dati vengono salvati o letti.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Regole di Rappresentazione:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;- &lt;b&gt;Processi&lt;/b&gt;: Usare sempre un Verbo + Nome (es. Verifica disponibilità). Devono sempre avere almeno un input e un output (niente &quot;buchi neri&quot;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;- &lt;b&gt;Entità&lt;/b&gt;: Rappresentano il confine esterno. Non possono mai parlare direttamente con un Data Store (serve sempre un processo nel mezzo)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;- &lt;b&gt;Flussi (Frecce)&lt;/b&gt;: Devono contenere solo Nomi (es. Titolo libro). Descrivono &quot;cosa&quot; passa, non &quot;come&quot; lo fa.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;- &lt;b&gt;Data Store&lt;/b&gt;: Rappresentano dati a riposo. Il nome deve essere un sostantivo (es. Catalogo).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Tutti i flussi che entrano o escono dal sistema al Livello 0 (es. Richiesta Libro) devono essere presenti anche al Livello 1, per garantire la coerenza dell'analisi.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: initial; text-align: left;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: initial; text-align: left;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: initial; text-align: left;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: initial; text-align: left;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: initial; text-align: left;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: initial; text-align: left;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: initial; text-align: left;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="shape=note;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;size=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#666600;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="720" y="35" width="350" height="445" as="geometry"/>
